    {
      "uid": "zhcn:daf2ad9d4107699197a0d489",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是训练员便找了目白麦昆，\n请她帮忙一起共同训练。\n目白麦昆爽快地答应。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98c8328a3a3505a452b7a0332a918eb42c66592ec5c767d26f1b309254f7e171",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
