    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d89f53e6416644dd6c578d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，目白麦昆却表示──\n过度在意魔咒才会失去平常心。\n应该更专注于自己的跑法才对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea4f870dd62a3c2d3d16738b05a37a169a0e058b3f51ff24a20bbfc929a692c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:321cba8a4c579d4ea5e02faf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
