    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bd1205b257b00347def92ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然里见光钻尝试强化自己步伐的力道，\n却因此乱了步调，连成绩也跟着下滑。\n距离比赛已经剩没多少时间了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2867b16cea1f6c34b51bda6461e349a57e4329bc62eefbfc79bd5dedbc4a5719",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067404.json",
      "json_path": [
