    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35c393aa0b846a390f02e4d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她决心要找回属于自己的跑法，\n却始终不见改善。\n这才意识到自己已经忘了原本的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30f65af74cdd3df7a62c1257367eeb3c1cb4859a7b9a6b2063ff4cef349dc70d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067404.json",
