    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b50c6380bd6c5cf737459f1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里见光钻想起过去一直\n一心一意地追着北部玄驹的自己。\n不知不觉也找回了原本的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8185d096a74109f3229f8125d2462679a4e171f63e0867553d9c4b361f107a5c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:672588303eb6f8df012abfb7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "遥远的前方，持续追逐",
      "source_fingerprint": "eebd957df299f5ab3faaf01cb55213eb1e0b0ba3da63164495a3deaa10039811",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1067/storytimeline_501067404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4d796571f902341f1bee7d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
