    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdae67abb985ccf61d87bc5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每年惯例的夏季集训开始了！\n在集训宿舍的时候，\n北部玄驹来向里见光钻搭话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "145f6f836387f7b2db68730dd091efc0617fc3bdb927e7e7ae813b88e7d9fb9c",
