      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“皋月赏”当天早晨是暴风雨般的天气。\n搭乘出租车前往赛场的路上\n因为路况拥塞而被困在半路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c5eeb384523ed9b101b2d0124bcdd6e07ef6110c88423f6936e0fa43ef5b04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
