      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "眼看时间就快赶不上，\n里见光钻从出租车上下车，\n决定用跑的赶去赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14925e79f090a302a5f0c0dcb9904b2a6b33a58302415d51a963fd3af4c866f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
